  "releaseNotes": "- Config: Isolates per-input demuxer options from saved settings and separates cookies for primary and fallback opens\n\t\t- Config: Preserves configured audio frame limits during recording\n\t\t- Config: Preserves video filter preferences and precision across video processor switches and prevents configuration serialization from modifying runtime settings\n\t\t- Statistics: Improves bitrate calculation accuracy and prevents spikes across seeks, queue clears and statistics collection restarts\n\t\t- Audio: Exposes active XAudio2 voice formats\n\t\t- Renderer: Exposes the applied swap-chain format, color space and HDR state through SwapChainOutput\n\t\t- Player: Exposes active audio and video streams and their buffered durations with property change notifications\n\t\t- Player: Improves property change notifications when disposing players or toggling engine UI refresh",
